# FILTER's cutoff is the FX row's AMOUNT knob: with the FILTER effect it reads CUTOFF, in Hz
wait 300
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect rowof 3
turn K1 5
wait 100
wait 100
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
tap FX
expect rowof 2
turn K2 -100
turn K2 55
wait 150
shot fx_cutoff.png
turn K2 100
wait 150
shot fx_cutoff_top.png
